      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "The next period gives 138. Double 2 → 4; choose 3 because 43×3 = 129.\nRemainder 9; bring 24 → 924.\nDouble 23 → 46; choose 2 because 462×2 = 924.\n\n√53824 = 232.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
