    "teach_7": {
      "id": "teach_7",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Long division can continue past the decimal point when the root is not exact.\n\nFor √3, the digits begin 1.732…\n\n1.7² = 2.89\n1.73² = 2.9929",
